  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "## 两日查询概览\n\n这是合成测试数据，用于验证全局筛选；不代表真实 Trino 查询结果。全量包含 550 次查询、15 次失败。下方可按日期和集群查看预先计算的结果。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed",
      "kind": "metric",
      "datasetId": "summary",
      "columnId": "query_count",
      "rowIndex": 0,
      "label": "完整快照查询数"
    },
    {
      "id": "count",
      "kind": "metric",
      "datasetId": "summary",
      "columnId": "query_count",
      "rowSelection": "slice",
      "label": "当前查询数"
    },
    {
      "id": "failed",
      "kind": "metric",
      "datasetId": "summary",
      "columnId": "failed_count",
      "rowSelection": "slice",
      "label": "当前失败数"
    },
    {
      "id": "rate",
      "kind": "metric",
      "datasetId": "summary",
      "columnId": "failure_rate",
      "rowSelection": "slice",
      "label": "当前失败率（%）"
    },
    {
      "id": "chart",
      "kind": "chart",
      "datasetId": "detail",
      "chart": "bar",
      "x": "category",
      "y": ["query_count"],
      "numericMode": "exact",
      "preparedViews": [
        {
          "id": "horizontal",
          "label": "横向比较",
          "datasetId": "detail",
          "chart": "horizontalBar",
          "x": "category",
          "y": ["query_count"],
          "numericMode": "exact"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "table",
      "kind": "table",
      "datasetId": "detail"
    },
    {
      "id": "limitations",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "## 口径说明\n\n失败率由 Python 按当前组合的失败数 / 查询数预先计算，单位为 %。每个筛选组合均有完整快照，阅读器不重新求和或计算比例。"
    }
  ],
